    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for Rosai&ndash;Dorfman disease</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Section contributors - separate source citation not necessary",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" width=\"605\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><em>Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">A population of large histiocytes with round nuclei, vesicular chromatin, distinct nucleoli, and abundant pale cytoplasm</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">AND</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Negativity for Langerhans cell markers (CD1a and/or CD207 [langerin]) and positivity for S100</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: black; \">Desirable:</span></em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Emperipolesis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Exclusion of reactive and demyelinating lesions</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Exclusion of other lines of differentiation (glial, epithelial, melanocytic, lymphocytic, meningothelial, etc.)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Nuclear cyclin&nbsp;D1 expression</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">BRAF</span></em><span style=\"color: black; \">, </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">MAP2K1</span></em><span style=\"color: black; \">, and </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">KRAS</span></em><span style=\"color: black; \"> or </span><em style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">NRAS</span></em><span style=\"color: black; \"> mutation status</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Potential systemic manifestations on imaging</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
